{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "store/rooms-are-found-by-organization-status-and-metadata",
  "title": "find_rooms finds the rooms of the organization it names, in the status it names, whose metadata holds each key and value it names, and every room when it names none",
  "rules": [
    "§14.1"
  ],
  "requirements": [
    "RK-14.1-014"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: store/memory.py find_rooms; roomkit-rs InMemoryStore::find_rooms. Each room differs from room-a1 by one of the three: its organization, its status, or its metadata's value; the filters given together each narrow the rooms found. Not observed: what a metadata_filter of several keys, or of a nested value, matches, which the RFC does not say (§14.1 gives the parameter, not its rule). The rooms' order is none the RFC gives.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "store.create_room",
      "room": {
        "id": "room-a1",
        "organization_id": "org-a",
        "metadata": {
          "tier": "gold",
          "region": "eu"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "store.create_room",
      "room": {
        "id": "room-a2",
        "organization_id": "org-a",
        "metadata": {
          "tier": "silver"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "store.create_room",
      "room": {
        "id": "room-a3",
        "organization_id": "org-a",
        "status": "closed",
        "metadata": {
          "tier": "gold"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "store.create_room",
      "room": {
        "id": "room-b1",
        "organization_id": "org-b",
        "metadata": {
          "tier": "gold"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "store.find_rooms",
      "organization_id": "org-a",
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "$unordered": [
            {
              "id": "room-a1"
            },
            {
              "id": "room-a2"
            },
            {
              "id": "room-a3"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "store.find_rooms",
      "status": "closed",
      "expect": {
        "result": [
          {
            "id": "room-a3"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "store.find_rooms",
      "metadata_filter": {
        "tier": "gold"
      },
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "$unordered": [
            {
              "id": "room-a1"
            },
            {
              "id": "room-a3"
            },
            {
              "id": "room-b1"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "store.find_rooms",
      "organization_id": "org-a",
      "status": "active",
      "metadata_filter": {
        "tier": "gold"
      },
      "expect": {
        "result": [
          {
            "id": "room-a1"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "store.find_rooms",
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "$unordered": [
            {
              "id": "room-a1"
            },
            {
              "id": "room-a2"
            },
            {
              "id": "room-a3"
            },
            {
              "id": "room-b1"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
